          <div style="font-size:12px; color:var(--text-on-dark-muted);">Quiet hours active 10:00 PM – 7:00 AM · Strict Mode ready</div>
        </div>
        <div class="info-card">
          <div style="font-size:13px; font-weight:700;">Try it right now</div>
          <p style="font-size:12px; color:var(--text-secondary); line-height:1.4;">
            Open YouTube and tap Shorts—Outloop will step in automatically without closing your search session.
          </p>
