### Next Step: Syncing Everything into Your Android App

Once you drop these HTML files into `Outloop-ui/`, you now have a complete visual reference for every screen in `app/src/main/java/com/example/ui/screens/`. You can point your local coding agent directly to `Outloop-ui/` (including the new `onboarding.html`, `manage-apps.html`, `app-detail.html`, `privacy.html`, and `diagnostics.html`) so it translates all screens—not just the main 3 tabs—into Jetpack Compose consistently.